<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Allstate cut to outperform.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Allstate cut to outperform.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers said it downgraded Allstate Corp to outperform from buy.</p>
<p>-- said maintained a year-end price target of $78 a share.</p>
<p>-- said still believes Allstate's shares are undervalued, but sees fewer catalysts over that next two quarter that will allow the stock to sustain its recent performance levels.</p>
<p>-- said a share repurchase plan could serve as a catalyst, but that is not expected to occur until the second half of the year.</p>
<p>-- Allstate lost 3/8 to 66-5/8.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
